THE LICENSOR
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

soulshine — (verb) the act of letting Jesus' light shine through you.

Soulshine is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit based in Tulsa, Oklahoma. It is a Christian
young adult ministry serving artists rather than athletes: a community-group
and festival model built for high school, college, and young adult students in
vocal, theater, band, orchestra, and audiovisual arts, structured after the
Fellowship of Christian Athletes.

Where most outreach ministries depend on solicited donations, Soulshine is
designed to fund its own work in each market — through art shows, music
festivals, theatrical productions, and annual awards events — supporting
scholarships, community outreach, and music and arts education.

