MANIFEST.sha256, a SEAL_MANIFEST, or a provenance record — and the published
execution receipts reproduce only against those exact bytes.

Inserting a license header into a hash-covered file would change its hash,
break the manifest, and invalidate the reproduction record that is the
principal evidentiary claim of this repository.

The license therefore applies at the repository level, through this NOTICE and
the LICENSE file. This is deliberate, not an oversight. Do not add headers to
